/**
 * @page launch_shell Shell launcher
 * @brief Run an SCF or variable-cell relaxation in a fresh directory.
 *
 * Usage from the course root:
 * @code{.sh}
 * bash scripts/run_calculation.sh scf 4
 * bash scripts/run_calculation.sh relaxation 4
 * @endcode
 *
 * The first argument selects the input. The second selects the MPI process
 * count. SIESTA_EXE optionally identifies the executable. Output is stored
 * under runs/ and existing runs are preserved.
 *
 * Doxygen does not natively parse Bash functions. This is an explanatory page
 * plus a included source listing; it is not a generated Bash call graph.
 *
 * @include run_calculation.sh
 */
